        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at cogen with biogas engine, methane 96%-vol allocation exergy
na;
UUID: e3097da4-24af-374f-ac99-58ffc2f60372
This dataset contains the generation of heat in a biomethane driven CHP based on PSI data (BFE project 407, Christian Bauer, April 2012).; Geography: PSI data (BFE project 407). Emissions and efficiencies adjusted to Swiss emission regulation (LRV, Luftreinhalteverordnung) valid in year 2000.
Location:  PSI data (BFE project 407). Emissions and efficiencies adjusted to Swiss emission regulation (LRV, Luftreinhalteverordnung) valid in year 2000.
Technology: Average technology available on market.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. Manufacturer information. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e3097da4-24af-374f-ac99-58ffc2f60372.xml</text>
